menu "Pajoniiir storage compatibility"
config PAJONIIIR_SD_IDLE_WAIT
    bool "Experimental yielding SDMMC idle wait (IDF 6.0.2)"
    default n
    help
        One CMD13 per tick instead of a command storm. Keep off in ordinary
        builds until SD latency and audio/USB A/B hardware acceptance passes.
        SPI uses the original implementation. An IDF upgrade requires review.
endmenu
